# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
# custos.o is Exsecutor-emitted C: the DCF datagram gate (examples/custos/)
# over the entry-23 codec, GPL-2.0-only under Exsecutor LICENSE.EXCEPTION
# Exception A. It is pure: no allocation, no I/O, no capability clause.
# Its only import is exsrt_abortus, supplied by exsrt_abortus.o.
#
# CAVEAT (roadmap K2 item 3, open): a trap in the emitted unit calls
# exsrt_abortus, which BUG()s. An LSM must fail closed by RETURNING -EPERM,
# which the _Noreturn trap ABI cannot do. custos.o is wired in so the Kbuild
# shape is proven end to end, but nothing here may become a hook until the
# trap ABI returns a verdict.
#
# Do not add prologue.c.in. Do not add Exsecutor runtime.

obj-m := exsecutor_enforce.o
exsecutor_enforce-y := mod.o exsrt_abortus.o custos.o
